Description: iio: accel: add the Kionix KXP74
 A three-axis analogue accelerometer with a 12-bit ADC on SPI (mode 3):
 a command byte starts an axis conversion and the result follows 50 us
 later. Raw channels with a ratiometric scale and offset; no interrupt.
